\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi236glgAUrBeSmf2pF8A5hWrhyZaGvExDDyZlo151ePLP3TAS0bB_WRV66rZvNTGhjzAS56jl6ySPryIfMq5XM-B106UdG3fHdieKv6PdEubMjmCsVxxbYk8StvlzW8aLKcpR92ejIebQrkwtDRoqJ0NaQc8QpjmmyF6gqMdnqj2Et2N1GwY8QxNyfsm4Y=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEitLf9u45j6V-jFyBs-dieMmzL-x0vXzztEMC5l_RfyAsLeLucgQAwr2C3D9oP3l6lE3N_2C5I9V6H2xA5XzLs874SDddeE-pfPX8oviAyD5YJVpFfGlSvgaZHdqPbdH1Pgp7EtLhkg7yBm1EtNBYrmHFCbC3WaF1knS_EKxm8hLGRNqFTUXkNrtlCXo3Jb\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEitLf9u45j6V-jFyBs-dieMmzL-x0vXzztEMC5l_RfyAsLeLucgQAwr2C3D9oP3l6lE3N_2C5I9V6H2xA5XzLs874SDddeE-pfPX8oviAyD5YJVpFfGlSvgaZHdqPbdH1Pgp7EtLhkg7yBm1EtNBYrmHFCbC3WaF1knS_EKxm8hLGRNqFTUXkNrtlCXo3Jb=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjplD-Gevz5j8jYjWoCKq9e8kYkOX_HN8nzbc8qyng9ZXKRJ1pbSaqXbo1pej0aKzrkJUhYWzZwC0rDBnFuf607alXCHnk3Mnrq0Rff2I1erSXUNzMXNYiYKmHbW7uzxbfrJGRjFNNNkDXqC5KtaWmBcPmssQno5CHT9i6Gb8CiXVlNU9y7rdOkuqfKFQ2d\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjplD-Gevz5j8jYjWoCKq9e8kYkOX_HN8nzbc8qyng9ZXKRJ1pbSaqXbo1pej0aKzrkJUhYWzZwC0rDBnFuf607alXCHnk3Mnrq0Rff2I1erSXUNzMXNYiYKmHbW7uzxbfrJGRjFNNNkDXqC5KtaWmBcPmssQno5CHT9i6Gb8CiXVlNU9y7rdOkuqfKFQ2d=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「大氣河」（tāi-khì-hô，atmospheric river）tsit个詞tsit幾冬是愈來愈tshìng，新聞iah是社群媒體不sám時就看--著。大氣河m̄是新現象，tsit 12年來suah愈來愈濟人beh研究，就是因為in tiānn-tiānn ē造成大風雨、起pò頭</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">，對lán ê環境不止仔要緊。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">不而過，大氣河到底是啥貨--leh？大氣河就是天頂ê一港大港風leh傳溼氣，一條長長幾若千公里。大氣河若來，天就gâu siàng大雨、起大風，有時仔koh ē做大水。世界各地ê海岸地區特別傷重。比論講lán台灣，若來到芒種前後兩禮拜ê黃酸雨季，大氣河就真旺。In若來，就驚大風大水起災禍，若無來，koh驚tsiánn水欠用。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">講大氣河親像河，講bóng講，suah mā m̄是土地頂hit款tshiâng-tsāi ê河。大氣河ê強度kah位置隨時lóng leh變，逐工to無仝款，bē輸tī天頂leh跳舞。In ê舞步m̄是人編--ê，是風ê物理kah溼氣ê物理做伙來編舞。Íng過ê科學家分別去研究風ê物理kah溼氣ê物理，m̄-koh lán需要一个合齊ê系統來看風kah溼氣按怎「合奏」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮ê團隊2024年發表tī《Nature Communications》期刊ê論文利用一个新ê系統來看風kah水氣。阮用「溼動能」（Vapor Kinetic Energy，VKE）來kā風kah溼氣ê物理kap做伙看，可比是看ē著規隻象，m̄是kan-na看著象ê各部份。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">論到偵測大氣河，阮發現講用溼動能ê效果kah íng過ê偵測法是平好，m̄-koh若論到認bat大氣河ê物理，阮就看著溼動能ê好處：ē-tàng解sueh大氣河演變ê原理。Tse是有史以來頭一擺，阮偵測大氣河兼認bat in ê物理，tsiâu看仝一个物理變數——溼動能khah強ê所在就是大氣河，大氣河ē演變是因為溼動能演變。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮發現講大氣河ê溼動能來源主要是「位能」（potential energy）轉做「動能」（kinetic energy）——親像囡仔tshu tshu仔，失去kuân度、得著速度——溼氣tshu落空中ê等壓面</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> mā ē得著動能。Koh，大氣河失去溼動能是經過溼氣凝做雲雨kah動能散做亂流tsit兩款物理。Tsia ê溼動能收支若拍平，大氣河就ē維持強度。論到大氣河徙位ê因端，he是風leh吹溼動能，也就是水平平流（tsúi-pîng pîng-liû）</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">看本文所kah ê圖thang知溼動能ê路用。Tse是2023年正月初4 tī美國加州tsiūnn岸ê大氣河案件，本圖用溼動能ê收支來分拆本案件ê演變。頂半圖有「積溼動能」ê等值線地圖——積--字表示規柱ê大氣lóng總ê溼動能量，色水愈tìm表示積溼動能愈厚。下半圖算出各項物理作用對本大氣河ê積溼動能ê收入kah支出。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán thìng好用溼動能ê概念來進一步研究真濟要緊ê問題，比論講：氣候變化按怎影響大氣河ê頻率、延時、風速、溼度、降水強度等等。Lán愈了解大氣河ê物理，就愈有才調thang準備應對未來ê大氣河hōo lán ê挑戰。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgaf0tKiCvIE4_-13GDy1FD4xV6xRP04Em2YkIr6ll9-Ds24QEDrATqPC689KYz0Gq5vgJ42D8q50xxNAyUvvidn1Gs4oL9Hy2r6Y26fiAvgS5_SoT5vOZHiMUXBNpHncOrxfJK6weUu8XGY_y7rGbfB29lLHeYHFM5KvWFVNHsC3KCoxauEWN73aAnm-dG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"646\" data-original-width=\"579\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgaf0tKiCvIE4_-13GDy1FD4xV6xRP04Em2YkIr6ll9-Ds24QEDrATqPC689KYz0Gq5vgJ42D8q50xxNAyUvvidn1Gs4oL9Hy2r6Y26fiAvgS5_SoT5vOZHiMUXBNpHncOrxfJK6weUu8XGY_y7rGbfB29lLHeYHFM5KvWFVNHsC3KCoxauEWN73aAnm-dG=w573-h640\" width=\"573\" /></a></div><br /><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1&nbsp; Ē起大風、siàng大雨ê中尺度對流系統。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">2&nbsp; 比論講lán若kā空中氣壓850 hPa ê所在連--起-來，ē連出一phiàn「850 hPa等壓面」，kuân度平均1.5 km，m̄-koh ná像海面án-ne有時起有時落。氣流tshu落等壓面ê時tsūn就有位能轉做動能。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">3 水平ê風kā風頭ê空氣吹--來，致使tsia-ê空氣變做khah成風頭hia。比論講風頭hia khah溼，水平ê風吹--來致使tsia變khah溼，tse就號做「水平ê溼平流」。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">論文原文：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">Ong, Hing &amp; Yang, Da. Vapor kinetic energy for the detection and understanding of atmospheric rivers. Nat, Commun. 15, 9428 (2024).&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（網址：https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-53369-0）</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear